          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyakuruga haiguru akira boona; baitu anyakuruga omunsi aikara ali w'ensi, kandi agamba eby'ensi. Anyakuruga omwiguru akira boona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi agumya ebi yarozire n'ebi yahuliire; baitu busaho n'omu anyakwikiriza obwakaiso bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyakwikiriza obwakaiso bwe aba agumiize kimu Ruhanga nkooku ali w'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningira Ruhanga ou yatumire, ayegesa ebigambo bya Ruhanga, habwokuba akamuha Mwoyo atarukubalirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 11:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga Ise agonza Mwana, kandi ebintu byona akabimukwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyakwikiriza Mwana, aina obwomeezi obutahwaho; baitu atarukworobera Mwana, talitunga bwomeezi; kandi obukaya bwa Ruhanga obutagarukirra bumwikaraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.3.36"
            ]
          }
        }
